<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-12T18:04:58.975Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:04:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Three men were sentenced for murdering Australian surfer brothers and their American friend on a surf trip in Mexico, while journalist Hamurabi Huesca Manzano was killed in Oaxaca, showing continued cartel-linked attacks on civilians and media. A prison riot in Sinaloa state killed ten inmates and injured sixteen, indicating expanding violence into detention facilities. Cartel influence is also seen in the theft of U.S. rental cars to build luxury fleets, the targeting of children of cartel leaders in California, and threats against a Mexican bishop who spoke out on violence. The conflict has long roots, with 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNU18tcnNhTGdLbTAwR01DYmZvb082OU9vT1I5RkUyTlJsMTBqaHhQTTEzTTBhbVlwaWRqdmNXdFFuZFpQcE5POGpqdjJKUWllUUNLT3dCTjJJRkp6SkZaZ2hKd3dvUHBUdGdCaUF4LWpVenZaUzR4eExpeWdkeXo0OXh2WW53YUhLUjNhUTZNNTByZHRoSE1WMzlSTm5Ba2RZeWloaG1KVEZtVVVTSFd2VnZzTDBuSm56dUVaYXM2bXlBTUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5URjRXUjlHSmFuVWpYQnYzZFlUN090QVVQeWRDUmQ4MUwzS05sVzVhR2N1dTJBQjlmTTd6a0tZRkNDZUV5eG1DNEd5UDRabW0tTC1DdWdxd085dmk5UUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.-?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOTDFycFdwSkY5aEQxNUI1Z2xYSDJ2S3VOb0lvT0ZzbmF2QkhkTjEtYklBNkdZOVdGNG5zSWI2ZEtzS0ItZGl0c3hGMmh4WDBoeS14cDRHRllweUFQc2NXR1pUQ0p0R0pZV1JFWk1uMW5mbzhMOFZLQ0lZT0JrSXZnMUJrYTI5b09OSTREeXdDSXNNVW5BYklsZjQtOXF6RWJxWm1RbUNtaXc?oc=5&q